{"id": "155460", "name": "תחום התכנסות של טור חזקות Σpⁿxⁿ/n^q", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"> </p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">נתבונן בטור הבא:</p>\n<p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\" dir=\"rtl\">\\[ \\displaystyle{\\sum_{n=1}^\\infty \\frac{{CT:0}}{{CT:1}}{{CT:2}}}\\]</p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">מצאו את תחום ההתכנסות של הטור. </p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">את התשובה יש להזין כביטוי לוגי כדוגמת הביטוי הבא</p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: center;\" dir=\"rtl\">\\[ x&gt;= -7\\mbox{ and } x&lt;5\\]</p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">תוך שימוש בסימנים</p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: center;\" dir=\"rtl\">\\[ &lt;, &lt;=, &gt;, &gt;=, =, and, or \\]</p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">לדוגמא הביטוי למעלה מתאר את התחום \\[ [-7,5) \\].</p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">את הביטוי \"כל x\" יש להזין כ <span>\\[ x&gt;= 0\\mbox{ or } x&lt;0\\]</span></p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span><span>ואת הביטוי \"אף x\" יש להזין כ </span><span>\\[ x&gt;= 0\\mbox{ and } x&lt;0\\]</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: center;\" dir=\"rtl\">[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] </p>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "varsl:listofvars(expand(ans1));\nans1e:expand(ans1);\nfor i:1 while i<=length(varsl) do (ans1e:ev(ans1e,varsl[i]=x));", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1e", "tans": "ta1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">תשובה נכונה, כל הכבוד!</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 9, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1e", "tans": "an[1]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.4, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span>בדקו שוב את ההתכנסות בקצוות התחום.</span></p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1e", "tans": "an[2]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.4, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span>בדקו שוב את ההתכנסות בקצוות התחום.</span></p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1e", "tans": "an[3]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.4, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-T", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span>בדקו שוב את ההתכנסות בקצוות התחום.</span></p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "Result-4-F", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"><span> </span></p>"}}, {"name": 4, "answe